TI  - Spatio-temporal characteristics of cultural ecosystem services and their relations to landscape factors in Hangzhou Xixi National Wetland Park, China
T2  - ECOLOGICAL INDICATORS
LA  - English
KW  - Correlation
KW  - Cultural ecosystem services
KW  - Social media photos
KW  - Spatial distribution characteristics
