TI  - Using Social Media Camping Data for Evaluating, Quantifying, and Understanding Recreational Ecosystem Services in Post-COVID-19 Megacities: A Case Study from Beijing
T2  - FORESTS
LA  - English
KW  - recreational ecosystem service
