TI  - Earth observation and social media: Evaluating the spatiotemporal contribution of non-native trees to cultural ecosystem services
T2  - REMOTE SENSING OF ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Aesthetics
KW  - Plant invasion
KW  - Protected area
KW  - Remote sensing
